 "teaches": [
  "A calculator screen in three library calls: InputsResult around a Card, ChoiceChips and Steppers",
  "Compute the result once in resources.variables, rounded to what is shown, and derive the band from the rounded number so the word and the number never disagree",
  "A repeat tap on a choice still runs its onClick: compare with a copy of the old index (@was) so a conversion happens once"
 ],
